<title>USA: Maple River ISD 2135, Minn., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Maple River ISD 2135, Minn., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc said it won $5.885 million of Maple River Independent School District No. 2135, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.3411 percent.</p>
</text>
